A=\begin{bmatrix}6 & 3 & -24 \\ -1 & -1 & -7 \\ 8 & 9 & -9\end{bmatrix},\,B=\begin{bmatrix}0 & 3 & 0 \\ 1 & -1 & -15 \\ -10 & 9 & 63\end{bmatrix}
$$

By applying elementary column operations of the form $C_i:=C_i+kC_{2},$ the matrix $A$ can be transformed into the matrix $B.$ What are the elementary column operations?"] [:db/add "23d27102-fcbd-5d8d-9f38-9d26cbb6fb6b" :question/worked-solution "To transform $A$ into $B,$ we need to make entries to the left and to the right of $a_{12}=3$ equal to $0.$

To do this, we can apply the following elementary column operations:

$$
\begin{aligned}A &=\begin{bmatrix}6 & 3 & -24 \\ -1 & -1 & -7 \\ 8 & 9 & -9\end{bmatrix}
\\ &\xrightarrow{C_{1}:=C_{1}-2C_{2}}\begin{bmatrix}0 & 3 & -24 \\ 1 & -1 & -7 \\ -10 & 9 & -9\end{bmatrix}
\\ &\xrightarrow{C_{3}:=C_{3}+8C_{2}}\begin{bmatrix}0 & 3 & 0 \\ 1 & -1 & -15 \\ -10 & 9 & 63\end{bmatrix}\\ &=B\end{aligned}
$$

Therefore, the elementary column operations are

$C_{1}:=C_{1}-2C_{2}$ and $C_{3}:=C_{3}+8C_{2}$."] [:db/add "23d27102-fcbd-5d8d-9f38-9d26cbb6fb6b" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "23d27102-fcbd-5d8d-9f38-9d26cbb6fb6b" :question/answer-fields "b5a2a1cf-019d-5be1-978f-99d2d5de03d0"] [:db/ensure "23d27102-fcbd-5d8d-9f38-9d26cbb6fb6b" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186161968 :knowledge-point/questions "23d27102-fcbd-5d8d-9f38-9d26cbb6fb6b"] [:db/add "b4b4cfb6-1190-5134-bf19-9f3ba8a55cbe" :answer/id #uuid "b4b4cfb6-1190-5134-bf19-9f3ba8a55cbe"] [:db/add "b4b4cfb6-1190-5134-bf19-9f3ba8a55cbe" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "b4b4cfb6-1190-5134-bf19-9f3ba8a55cbe" :answer/value "$C_{1}:=C_{1}+3C_{3}$ and $C_{2}:=C_{2}-5C_{3}$"] [:db/ensure "b4b4cfb6-1190-5134-bf19-9f3ba8a55cbe" :answer/validate] [:db/add "e6ed73e2-e9a4-5fd3-affc-e03ef09a114b" :answer/id #uuid "e6ed73e2-e9a4-5fd3-affc-e03ef09a114b"] [:db/add "e6ed73e2-e9a4-5fd3-affc-e03ef09a114b" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "e6ed73e2-e9a4-5fd3-affc-e03ef09a114b" :answer/value "$C_{1}:=C_{1}-5C_{3}$ and $C_{2}:=C_{2}+3C_{3}$"] [:db/ensure "e6ed73e2-e9a4-5fd3-affc-e03ef09a114b" :answer/validate] [:db/add "6ff8dacb-3cfd-5fb0-8f4e-1752f9fa2713" :answer/id #uuid "6ff8dacb-3cfd-5fb0-8f4e-1752f9fa2713"] [:db/add "6ff8dacb-3cfd-5fb0-8f4e-1752f9fa2713" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "6ff8dacb-3cfd-5fb0-8f4e-1752f9fa2713" :answer/value "$C_{1}:=C_{1}-3C_{3}$ and $C_{2}:=C_{2}-5C_{3}$"] [:db/ensure "6ff8dacb-3cfd-5fb0-8f4e-1752f9fa2713" :answer/validate] [:db/add "17e26d2e-9277-5ce1-a7cf-65dea05ab38a" :answer/id #uuid "17e26d2e-9277-5ce1-a7cf-65dea05ab38a"] [:db/add "17e26d2e-9277-5ce1-a7cf-65dea05ab38a" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "17e26d2e-9277-5ce1-a7cf-65dea05ab38a" :answer/value "$C_{1}:=C_{1}+3C_{3}$ and $C_{2}:=C_{2}+5C_{3}$"] [:db/ensure "17e26d2e-9277-5ce1-a7cf-65dea05ab38a" :answer/validate] [:db/add "0a14c456-1e6b-52eb-b882-7a0bd2a42255" :answer/id #uuid "0a14c456-1e6b-52eb-b882-7a0bd2a42255"] [:db/a